---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import {contributedPrimarySources} from '../../../lib/contributed-primary-sources.mjs';
---
<Layout title="Documentary sources · NZ GIS History" description="Eight period sources for New Zealand GIS between 2007 and 2021, including strategies, Māori GIS, education and emergency mapping.">
 <article class="page-wrap">
  <p class="eyebrow">Documentary evidence</p>
  <h1 class="page-title">Historical source documents</h1>
  <p>These primary-source records are drawn from eight original files supplied for the GIS History project. Dates describe their documented publication or event, not the date files were uploaded or digitised. Publication rights and the original file's hosting status are recorded separately.</p>
  <ul class="list">
   {contributedPrimarySources.map(item=><li><a href={'/sources/documents/'+item.slug+'/'}>{item.title}</a><p>{item.date} · {item.creator}</p><p>{item.summary}</p></li>)}
  </ul>
  <p>Original files supplied for research have been checked by SHA-256. Documents without confirmed republication rights are described and cited here, rather than represented as hosted PDF downloads.</p>
 </article>
</Layout>
